  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA humanitarian reponse to Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPAs humanitarian reponse in Ukraine.

Norway`s contribution to SRH and SGBV by UNFPA`s response to both IDP and refugee needs within Ukraine and in neighboring countries as found in UNFPA&#x2019;s component of the Ukraine Situation and Regional Refugee Response Plan lead by UNHCR.</narrative>
  </description>
